  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As a group owner I would like to be able to support multi instance operations.  Allowing a permission so that certain members of my group can drop a portal that would stay out for an extended time period would help people to be able to pass between our multiple instances more easily and bring awareness that there were multiple instances running. \n\nWhile this feature seems to only apply to larger groups it also would be useful for smaller groups that may want to have a hang out instance and a game instance.  This allows for people who just want to chat to move to a hang out instance and for the people actively playing a game instance to have better performance not rendering avatars just socializing in a lobby.",
